# Initial menu traversal; validated state transcript identifies each transition.
# Values are game updates from the first controller read, independent of display Hz.
@ticks
90 100 START # leave title
200 210 A # accept menu
320 330 A # accept menu
440 450 A # accept menu
560 570 A # accept menu
680 690 A # accept menu
800 810 A # accept menu
950 3200 A # accelerate
1200 1290 - 22 0 # right turn
1500 1590 - -22 0 # left turn
1800 1810 CUP # camera
